{"sha":"e5dd9aa5012095c7f722ee7199e440ec289052ee","node_id":"C_kwDOTW8s4NoAKGU1ZGQ5YWE1MDEyMDk1YzdmNzIyZWU3MTk5ZTQ0MGVjMjg5MDUyZWU","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kvnloo/oh-my-pi/git/commits/e5dd9aa5012095c7f722ee7199e440ec289052ee","html_url":"https://github.com/kvnloo/oh-my-pi/commit/e5dd9aa5012095c7f722ee7199e440ec289052ee","author":{"name":"Kevin Rajan","email":"7121943+kvnloo@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-10-10T16:28:34Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kevin Rajan","email":"7121943+kvnloo@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-10-10T16:28:34Z"},"tree":{"sha":"f10057bd50ee1ac386269babea15d88e01598d4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kvnloo/oh-my-pi/git/trees/f10057bd50ee1ac386269babea15d88e01598d4d"},"message":"fix(tui): preserve graphemes in collapsed summaries\n\nAuthored by dot (AI assistant). Reuse the existing grapheme-aware terminal-width truncator for collapsed synthetic summary rows so joined emoji remain whole at the clipping boundary.\n\nFun10165 reported the advisor transcript problem and proposed the collapsed-summary context in #6308; roboomp implemented that original feature in #6313. This patch corrects its fallback row renderer.\n\nVerified locally against the exact parent with a failing-before/passing-after component regression, independent controls, focused TUI tests, and package lint/format/type checks.","parents":[{"sha":"1534f1a33954da73fc3c234cb0d146e6d6942f89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kvnloo/oh-my-pi/git/commits/1534f1a33954da73fc3c234cb0d146e6d6942f89","html_url":"https://github.com/kvnloo/oh-my-pi/commit/1534f1a33954da73fc3c234cb0d146e6d6942f89"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}}